    {
      "id": "claim_67eaf7b327b3435395a32c262fa38d1e",
      "statement": "AdGuard DNS integration syncs internal service DNS records to AdGuard Home instance at http://192.168.50.1:3000 using a webhook provider (ghcr.io/muhlba91/external-dns-provider-adguard:v11.1.1). It watches gateway-httproute and gateway-tlsroute sources, targeting the internal gateway, with credentials stored in adguard-dns-secret.",
