      "id": "claim_4b4e631b910343e5b2486097699381c0",
      "statement": "Internal service traffic resolves via k8s-gateway (192.168.50.11) or CoreDNS (10.43.0.10) to the internal Cilium Gateway (192.168.50.12) or service ClusterIPs. The gateway routes HTTPRoutes to backend services through Cilium's BPF load balancing. AdGuard DNS syncs records to AdGuard Home for local resolution.",
