      "statement": "The cluster uses distinct IP ranges: 10.42.0.0/16 for pod network (Cilium native routing), 10.43.0.0/16 for service network with CoreDNS at 10.43.0.10, 192.168.50.13 for external gateway, 192.168.50.12 for internal gateway, 192.168.50.11 for k8s-gateway DNS, 192.168.50.10 for cluster VIP and qBittorrent egress, all within the 192.168.50.0/24 local network.",
